# DRAW keymap preset: Photoshop  (SAFEST — only DRAW-free target keys remapped)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): a row is applied ONLY if its target key is currently UNBOUND
# in DRAW, so no DRAW default is displaced. The COLLISIONS block lists Photoshop keys
# that clash with DRAW defaults — rule on those in PLANS/PRESETS-KEYMAP-DECISIONS.md.
#
# Already matching Photoshop: B brush, E eraser, L line-ish, M marquee, T text, Z zoom,
# V move, Ctrl+Z/Y undo/redo, Ctrl+A/D select-all/deselect, Ctrl+T transform-ish.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# Ctrl+J  Layer via Copy  ->  DRAW "Copy to New Layer" (321). Ctrl+J is unbound in DRAW.
321 106 1 0

# --- COLLISIONS (need a decision; NOT applied) -------------------------------
#   G   Paint Bucket        -> DRAW G is a grid chord initiator (would lose grid chords)
#   C   Crop                -> DRAW C is Ellipse tool
#   P   Pen                 -> DRAW P is Polygon tool
#   U   Rectangle (shapes)  -> DRAW U is free-ish but a chord-safe letter; confirm
#   W   Magic Wand          -> DRAW W is Magic Wand ALREADY (match, no row needed)
#   I   Eyedropper          -> DRAW I is Picker ALREADY (match)
#   J   Spot Healing        -> no DRAW equivalent
#   S   Clone Stamp         -> DRAW S is Smart Shapes
#   Y   History Brush       -> no DRAW equivalent
#   Ctrl+Shift+N New Layer  -> DRAW already binds Ctrl+Shift+N to New Layer (match)
#   Ctrl+Shift+I Invert Sel -> DRAW already Ctrl+Shift+I (match)
